%% Status: built. shared/session/CaptureFlow.kt (CaptureState). The Android UiState mirrors it 1:1.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Guiding
    Guiding --> Guiding: tilt / coverage update
    Guiding --> CheckingPhoto: startCapture() (READY)
    CheckingPhoto --> PhotoAccepted: quality check passed
    CheckingPhoto --> PhotoRejected: quality check failed (reason)
    CheckingPhoto --> CaptureFailed: camera error
    PhotoAccepted --> Guiding: retake()
    PhotoRejected --> Guiding: retake()
    CaptureFailed --> Guiding: retake()
    Guiding --> CameraUnavailable: camera cannot bind
    Guiding --> LevelSensorUnavailable: no gravity sensor
    CameraUnavailable --> [*]
    LevelSensorUnavailable --> [*]
